    <description>Sum of issue of Open and Closed is constant for a week over time.e.g. Week 28 (10 Open + 41 closed ) -&gt; (7 Open + 44 Closed )  -&gt; ( 5 Open + 46 Closed )but sum will remain constant.</description>
    <filter>
